---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
---
<!-- TODO: review before applying to AdSense. This policy covers baitaandessigns.com and its es., pt. and ar. subdomains. -->
<Layout title="Privacy policy | Baitaan Tools" description="How Baitaan Tools handles your data and which cookies it uses.">
  <article class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-stone-700">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>This policy covers baitaandessigns.com and its subdomains es.baitaandessigns.com, pt.baitaandessigns.com and ar.baitaandessigns.com.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Data you enter</h2>
    <p>Our tools run in your browser. Numbers you type and files you choose are processed on your device and are not sent to our servers.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Cookies</h2>
    <p>Your theme and cookie choices are shared by baitaandessigns.com and its subdomains, so you only make them once. Your language choice is kept separately by each subdomain:</p>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead><tr class="text-stone-500"><th class="py-2 text-start font-medium">Cookie</th><th class="py-2 text-start font-medium">What it does</th><th class="py-2 text-start font-medium">Lasts</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="border-t border-stone-200"><td class="py-2 font-mono">bt_theme</td><td>Remembers whether you chose the light or dark theme. Without it, we follow your device setting.</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-t border-stone-200"><td class="py-2 font-mono">bt_lang</td><td>Set by es., pt. and ar. only: remembers whether you chose that site's language or English. Each subdomain keeps its own.</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-t border-stone-200"><td class="py-2 font-mono">bt_consent</td><td>Stores your cookie choice.</td><td>6 months</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>These three are necessary for the site to remember your settings and are not used to identify you.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Analytics and advertising</h2>
    <p>With your consent, we use Google Analytics to understand visits and Google AdSense to show personalised ads. Google and its partners may then use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to this and other sites. Until you choose, Google's tags run in a restricted mode that does not store analytics or advertising cookies (Google Consent Mode). If you reject, you may still see non-personalised ads.</p>
    <p>You can change your choice at any time with the “Cookie settings” link at the bottom of every page. You can also opt out of personalised ads in <a class="text-teal-800 underline" href="https://adssettings.google.com">Google Ads Settings</a>. Learn more at <a class="text-teal-800 underline" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">policies.google.com</a>.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Contact</h2>
    <p>hello@baitaandessigns.com</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
